msgid "plugins.generic.pidManager.pidinst.workflow.label"
msgstr "PIDINST"

msgid "plugins.generic.pidManager.pidinst.generalDescription"
msgstr ""
"The Persistent Identifier for Instruments (PIDINST) is a globally unique identifier for measuring "
"instruments operted in the sciences. Learn more at www.pidinst.org."

msgid "plugins.generic.pidManager.pidinst.workflow.instructions"
msgstr ""
"You can add PIDINSTs to a publication by searching with a DOI or title in the upper table, selecting from autocomplete suggestions, and avoiding duplicates (greyed-out). "
"Multiple PIDINSTs can be added at once. "
"The lower table displays the metadata that will appear in the article view and lets you edit it." 

msgid "plugins.generic.pidManager.pidinst.submission.instructions"
msgstr "Currently, PIDINSTs can only be set at a later stage in the editorial process. "
"Please contact the journal manager if you would like to add a PIDINST to your publication. "
"For future versions of the PID Manager, it is planned to allow PIDINSTs to be added in the submission wizard."

msgid "plugins.generic.pidManager.pidinst.workflow.addFromCsv.instructions"
